{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2021-08-11 16:30:00', 'title': 'NEWELL BRANDS DECLARES DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEWELL BRANDS INC. (NASDAQ: NWL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE DECLARATION OF A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.23 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 15, 2021 TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUGUST 31, 2021. ABOUT NEWELL BRANDS NEWELL BRANDS (NASDAQ: NWL) IS A LEADING GLOBAL CONSUMER GOODS COMPANY WITH A STRONG PORTFOLIO OF WELL-KNOWN BRANDS, INCLUDING RUBBERMAID®, PAPER MATE®, SHARPIE®, DYMO®, EXPO®, PARKER®, ELMER'S®, COLEMAN®, MARMOT®, OST"}